@startuml
title ViRAGE runtime pipeline

hide empty description
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

[*] --> DataProfiler
DataProfiler --> QueryRequestAnalysis
QueryRequestAnalysis --> DataPreparation
DataPreparation --> VisRAG
VisRAG --> ChartGenerator
ChartGenerator --> SpecValidator
SpecValidator --> TechnicalDecision
TechnicalDecision --> ChartGenerator : retry invalid spec
TechnicalDecision --> VegaLiteRendering : ok
VegaLiteRendering --> ScenegraphCheck
ScenegraphCheck --> EmptyChartCheck
EmptyChartCheck --> SpecScore

SpecScore --> AnalyticsTailGate
AnalyticsTailGate --> Completed : analytics_tail_enabled = false
AnalyticsTailGate --> SemanticLoopGate : analytics_tail_enabled = true

SemanticLoopGate --> VisualChartJudge : strict
SemanticLoopGate --> VLMChartDescription : debug_full_chain
SemanticLoopGate --> VLMAnalysis : disabled

VisualChartJudge --> SemanticDecision
VLMChartDescription --> ChartFactSummary
ChartFactSummary --> ChartAnswerJudge
ChartAnswerJudge --> SemanticDecision

SemanticDecision --> FeedbackCorpusWriter : retry
FeedbackCorpusWriter --> ChartGenerator
SemanticDecision --> VLMAnalysis : accepted
SemanticDecision --> EvaluationSummary : failed

VLMAnalysis --> EvaluationSummary
EvaluationSummary --> Completed
Completed --> [*]

note right of VisRAG
Runtime RAG retrieves rule guidance only.
It does not retrieve final Vega-Lite specs.
Compatibility reranker removes rules that
contradict query analysis or data shape.
end note

note right of AnalyticsTailGate
For NLV benchmark the analytics tail is disabled.
For InfiAgent it stays enabled because the answer
is judged from the chart-grounded analysis.
end note
@enduml
